    "displayName": "Retrieve Supplies",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hi,\n\nIt appears an electrical issue caused us to lose track of a [Ship] carrying medical supplies. Thankfully, I received word that the ship was found at [Location]. We really need someone to get out there and recover the supplies onboard before someone else does. Those provisions are desperately needed at [Destination]. Any chance you could grab them and complete the delivery? \n\nMakes me nervous seeing that the ship is at a lagrange point. Lots of folks scour them for stuff like this. Would be smart to come prepared to defend yourself if someone else comes looking to steal it.\n\nAlso, to make your life easier, I'd make sure you have a handheld tractor beam with you.    \n\nThanks,\n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
